    "sections": {
        "description": "Online Library Theme is a modern, versatile, and fully responsive template designed for bookshops, eBook stores, publishing houses, digital libraries, online book store platforms, reading portals, author showcase sites, education and learning resources, academic libraries, and eLearning book hubs. Ideal for managing small or large collections, it supports eBook shops, bookstore templates, digital reading platforms, and educational resource centers. The theme features clean navigation, organized categories, genres, and featured titles, and integrates seamlessly with WooCommerce for selling books, eBooks, and educational resources, while Contact Form 7 enables inquiries, subscriptions, and reader engagement. Fully customizable with colors, typography, layouts, and SEO-optimized for better search visibility, Online Library Theme ensures an optimal browsing experience across desktops, tablets, and smartphones, providing authors, publishers, educators, and book enthusiasts a professional, elegant, and conversion-focused platform to showcase, manage, and sell their collections. Demo : https://trial.ovationthemes.com/online-library/"
    },
